"Add your first server" = "添加第一台服务器";
"Choose hosts from your Mac’s SSH config or enter a server address." = "可以从这台 Mac 的 SSH 配置中选择主机，也可以手动填写服务器地址。";
"Import from This Mac…" = "从本机导入…";
"Import SSH servers" = "导入 SSH 服务器";
"Looking for SSH hosts…" = "正在查找 SSH 主机…";
