"Couldn’t read the SSH configuration." = "无法读取 SSH 配置。";
"Choose another folder or add a server manually from Home." = "请选择其他文件夹，或返回 Home 手动添加服务器。";
"Added %lld to Servers" = "已将 %lld 台主机添加到 Servers";
