"Choose the folder containing your OpenSSH config file." = "请选择包含 OpenSSH config 文件的文件夹。";
"Preview Hosts" = "预览主机";
"Close" = "关闭";
"Your SSH agent has no keys loaded." = "本机 SSH Agent 尚未加载密钥。";
"catussh could not reach your SSH agent." = "catussh 无法访问本机 SSH Agent。";
