"You can still save these hosts. Before connecting, choose a password or key file for the login in Identities." = "可以先保存主机。连接前，请在 Identities 中为对应账号选择密码或密钥文件。";
"Check Again" = "重新检查";
"Recursive OpenSSH Include in %@." = "%@ 中的 OpenSSH Include 出现循环或嵌套过深。";
